Note on bundled media

`assets/boot-fish.mp4` is a third-party clip: "deepseek harness大肥鱼开机动画欣赏"
by 吾为仙修, https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AkWA6yEti/. It is NOT covered by
the MIT licence above and is included only so the plugin works out of the box.
Replace it with your own recording, or set `source` in `fish-boot.json` to any
local video file. If you redistribute this repository, please keep this notice.
